  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 313.11,
      "e": 314.2,
      "text": "My name is Ed Haering,"
    },
    {
      "s": 314.2,
      "e": 314.5,
      "text": "I work"
    },
    {
      "s": 314.5,
      "e": 316.33,
      "text": "at the Armstrong Flight Research Center,"
    },
    {
      "s": 316.33,
      "e": 318.07,
      "text": "and I'm the principal investigator"
    },
    {
      "s": 318.07,
      "e": 320.82,
      "text": "for the carpet down phase two flights"
    },
    {
      "s": 320.82,
      "e": 321.25,
      "text": "of carpet"
    },
    {
      "s": 321.25,
      "e": 323.62,
      "text": "them stands for carpet determination"
    },
    {
      "s": 323.62,
      "e": 325.12,
      "text": "and entirety measurements."
    },
    {
      "s": 325.12,
      "e": 328.03,
      "text": "When a plane flies supersonic, the booms"
    },
    {
      "s": 328.03,
      "e": 329.68,
      "text": "come down and hit the ground in the area"
    },
    {
      "s": 329.68,
      "e": 331.26,
      "text": "we call the sonic boom carpet."
    },
    {
      "s": 331.26,
      "e": 332.76,
      "text": "So we want to grab the entire carpet"
    },
    {
      "s": 332.76,
      "e": 334.27,
      "text": "or seize the boom."
    },
    {
      "s": 334.27,
      "e": 337.15,
      "text": "And we're trying to evaluate"
    },
    {
      "s": 337.15,
      "e": 338.77,
      "text": "how our new sensors, the ground"
    },
    {
      "s": 338.77,
      "e": 341.07,
      "text": "recording systems, earthworks,"
    },
    {
      "s": 341.07,
      "e": 342.88,
      "text": "preparation for the x 59"
    },
    {
      "s": 342.88,
      "e": 343.69,
      "text": "and also test out"
    },
    {
      "s": 343.69,
      "e": 344.44,
      "text": "some new systems"
    },
    {
      "s": 344.44,
      "e": 346.45,
      "text": "to remotely"
    },
    {
      "s": 346.45,
      "e": 348.4,
      "text": "turn them on and off in the field."
    },
    {
      "s": 348.4,
      "e": 348.85,
      "text": "We're going to have"
    },
    {
      "s": 348.85,
      "e": 351.18,
      "text": "about 150 of these in the field."
    },
    {
      "s": 351.18,
      "e": 353.25,
      "text": "For tests with the x 59"
    },
    {
      "s": 353.25,
      "e": 355.36,
      "text": "and that's a lot of people to staff."
    },
    {
      "s": 355.36,
      "e": 356.86,
      "text": "So we want to make them more automatic"
    },
    {
      "s": 358.39,
      "e": 358.73,
      "text": "carpet"
    },
    {
      "s": 358.73,
      "e": 359.38,
      "text": "them as a"
    },
    {
      "s": 359.38,
      "e": 361.56,
      "text": "risk reduction getting ready for x 59"
    },
    {
      "s": 361.81,
      "e": 363.73,
      "text": "trying to get that remote triggering"
    },
    {
      "s": 363.73,
      "e": 365.46,
      "text": "of our reporting system."
    },
    {
      "s": 365.46,
      "e": 367.05,
      "text": "We tested two different systems."
    },
    {
      "s": 367.05,
      "e": 368.38,
      "text": "One was called four"
    },
    {
      "s": 368.38,
      "e": 369.97,
      "text": "and four allows"
    },
    {
      "s": 369.97,
      "e": 370.6,
      "text": "is to use"
    },
    {
      "s": 370.6,
      "e": 371.74,
      "text": "the transmissions"
    },
    {
      "s": 371.74,
      "e": 372.34,
      "text": "from the aircraft,"
    },
    {
      "s": 372.34,
      "e": 373.42,
      "text": "saying the aircraft"
    },
    {
      "s": 373.42,
      "e": 374.34,
      "text": "is at a certain place,"
    },
    {
      "s": 374.34,
      "e": 376.32,
      "text": "certain altitude, speed and direction."
    },
    {
      "s": 376.32,
      "e": 378.21,
      "text": "We take that information compute"
    },
    {
      "s": 378.21,
      "e": 380.35,
      "text": "when the sonic thump is going to hit"
    },
    {
      "s": 380.35,
      "e": 381.1,
      "text": "and use that"
    },
    {
      "s": 381.1,
      "e": 382.93,
      "text": "to turn our recorders on or off."
    },
    {
      "s": 382.93,
      "e": 384.33,
      "text": "We did four flights."
    },
    {
      "s": 384.33,
      "e": 386.82,
      "text": "We did 21 supersonic passes,"
    },
    {
      "s": 386.82,
      "e": 388.65,
      "text": "headwind tailwind straight overhead."
    },
    {
      "s": 388.65,
      "e": 390.37,
      "text": "We off to the side"
    },
    {
      "s": 390.37,
      "e": 392.29,
      "text": "to really exercise the capabilities"
    },
    {
      "s": 392.29,
      "e": 393.66,
      "text": "of these systems"
    },
    {
      "s": 394.26,
      "e": 394.78,
      "text": "in the cockpit."
    },
    {
      "s": 394.78,
      "e": 395.64,
      "text": "In phase one,"
    },
    {
      "s": 395.64,
      "e": 397.21,
      "text": "we deployed a lot of sensors"
    },
    {
      "s": 397.21,
      "e": 399.33,
      "text": "over a 30 mile array"
    },
    {
      "s": 399.51,
      "e": 400.53,
      "text": "trying to figure out how long"
    },
    {
      "s": 400.53,
      "e": 401.4,
      "text": "it took us to get out"
    },
    {
      "s": 401.4,
      "e": 402.49,
      "text": "there, set up all our equipment"
    },
    {
      "s": 402.49,
      "e": 404.05,
      "text": "and be ready for the planes to come over."
    },
    {
      "s": 404.05,
      "e": 405.82,
      "text": "So it's more of a logistics test,"
    },
    {
      "s": 405.82,
      "e": 407.97,
      "text": "whereas phase two is more focused"
    },
    {
      "s": 407.97,
      "e": 409.81,
      "text": "on the sensors themselves."
    },
    {
      "s": 409.81,
      "e": 410.89,
      "text": "How do they record,"
    },
    {
      "s": 410.89,
      "e": 411.36,
      "text": "how do we"
    },
    {
      "s": 411.36,
      "e": 412.03,
      "text": "how can we get them"
    },
    {
      "s": 412.03,
      "e": 414.13,
      "text": "to remotely turn on and off"
    },
    {
      "s": 414.13,
      "e": 415.38,
      "text": "for carpet in phase two?"
    },
    {
      "s": 415.38,
      "e": 416.28,
      "text": "Typical day was"
    },
    {
      "s": 416.28,
      "e": 418.27,
      "text": "we would set up our microphones up"
    },
    {
      "s": 418.27,
      "e": 419.62,
      "text": "in the field we had"
    },
    {
      "s": 420.57,
      "e": 421.15,
      "text": "a station"
    },
    {
      "s": 421.15,
      "e": 423.19,
      "text": "for microphones every 100 feet, over"
    },
    {
      "s": 423.91,
      "e": 427.78,
      "text": "600 feet, and we had both the gear us"
    },
    {
      "s": 428.11,
      "e": 430.06,
      "text": "and other microphones"
    },
    {
      "s": 430.06,
      "e": 431.38,
      "text": "that we've been using in the past,"
    },
    {
      "s": 431.38,
      "e": 432.33,
      "text": "kind of a"
    },
    {
      "s": 432.58,
      "e": 433.05,
      "text": "head to head"
    },
    {
      "s": 433.05,
      "e": 434.43,
      "text": "test of the new system"
    },
    {
      "s": 434.43,
      "e": 436.3,
      "text": "to our existing system."
    },
    {
      "s": 436.3,
      "e": 437.89,
      "text": "We would, before the flight,"
    },
    {
      "s": 437.89,
      "e": 439.5,
      "text": "get the weather of the day, plan out"
    },
    {
      "s": 439.5,
      "e": 440.56,
      "text": "when the booms would hit"
    },
    {
      "s": 440.56,
      "e": 441.72,
      "text": "and the exact flight conditions"
    },
    {
      "s": 441.72,
      "e": 442.86,
      "text": "the pilot had to"
    },
    {
      "s": 442.86,
      "e": 444.21,
      "text": "achieve to get the booms"
    },
    {
      "s": 444.21,
      "e": 445.96,
      "text": "where we wanted them"
    },
    {
      "s": 446.46,
      "e": 448.0,
      "text": "communicate that to the pilot."
    },
    {
      "s": 448.0,
      "e": 449.31,
      "text": "Pilot would"
    },
    {
      "s": 449.31,
      "e": 450.28,
      "text": "fly those flights"
    },
    {
      "s": 450.28,
      "e": 451.78,
      "text": "and about every 5 minutes"
    },
    {
      "s": 451.78,
      "e": 454.47,
      "text": "we'd get a boom on our array"
    },
    {
      "s": 454.84,
      "e": 456.34,
      "text": "and we'd get five"
    },
    {
      "s": 456.34,
      "e": 458.07,
      "text": "or six passes per flight."
    },
    {
      "s": 458.07,
      "e": 459.69,
      "text": "And then a lot of data to collect"
    },
    {
      "s": 459.69,
      "e": 460.29,
      "text": "and analyze"
    },
    {
      "s": 460.29,
      "e": 461.61,
      "text": "and coil up all the cable"
    },
    {
      "s": 461.61,
      "e": 463.48,
      "text": "and get ready for the next day."
    },
    {
      "s": 463.48,
      "e": 464.68,
      "text": "Carpet day was really important"
    },
    {
      "s": 464.68,
      "e": 466.78,
      "text": "to work out all the logistics"
    },
    {
      "s": 466.78,
      "e": 468.55,
      "text": "and all the hardware problems"
    },
    {
      "s": 468.55,
      "e": 470.44,
      "text": "were eventually going to have,"
    },
    {
      "s": 470.44,
      "e": 471.6,
      "text": "get them out of the way now"
    },
    {
      "s": 471.6,
      "e": 473.37,
      "text": "so that when we're ready for x 59,"
    },
    {
      "s": 473.37,
      "e": 475.14,
      "text": "there are no hiccups."
    },
    {
      "s": 475.14,
      "e": 476.83,
      "text": "We're developing new hardware"
    },
    {
      "s": 476.83,
      "e": 478.03,
      "text": "and new software techniques"
    },
    {
      "s": 479.0,
      "e": 480.58,
      "text": "new logistical techniques"
    },
    {
      "s": 480.58,
      "e": 482.2,
      "text": "to make sure that when Exit nine"
    },
    {
      "s": 482.2,
      "e": 483.7,
      "text": "flies, we're ready to get the"
    },
    {
      "s": 483.7,
